  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Plumping</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A peptide lip treatment, lip oil, and gloss in one that visibly plumps and hydrates, all while providing a juicy slick of color.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:</strong> </p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts water and locks in hydration.</p><p>- Peptides: Visibly plump.</p><p>- Evening Primrose Oil: Protects. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts: </strong>Free of sulfates SLS and SLES and parabens. This product is also vegan, and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Nourishing ingredients including hyaluronic acid, peptides, and evening primrose oil are clinically shown to visibly plump, hydrate, smooth, and firm—rapidly and over time. </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b><br>-Wet Lip Oil Gloss was made to ride solo or perfectly layer with other lipsticks and lip balms. <br>-Apply LipFuel first, then swipe on Weightless Lip Color and Wet Lip Oil Gloss for a long-lasting, super slick finish. (LipFuel and Weightless Lip Color sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Oleic/Linoleic/Linolenic Polyglycerides, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Silica Dimethyl Silylate; Caprylyl Glycol, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glucomannan, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Extract, Lactic Acid, Oenothera Biennis (Evening Primrose) Oil, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Tocopherol, Tribehenin, Trihydroxystearin, Vanillin, Limonene, Linalool, [May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 28 Lake (CI 45410)]<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hyaluronic Acid</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Plumping</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ High Shine Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A peptide lip treatment, lip oil, and gloss in one that visibly plumps and hydrates, all while providing a juicy slick of color.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:</strong> </p><p>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts water and locks in hydration.</p><p>- Peptides: Visibly plump.</p><p>- Evening Primrose Oil: Protects. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts: </strong>Free of sulfates SLS and SLES and parabens. This product is also vegan, and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">Nourishing ingredients including hyaluronic acid, peptides, and evening primrose oil are clinically shown to visibly plump, hydrate, smooth, and firm—rapidly and over time. </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:</b><br>-Wet Lip Oil Gloss was made to ride solo or perfectly layer with other lipsticks and lip balms. <br>-Apply LipFuel first, then swipe on Weightless Lip Color and Wet Lip Oil Gloss for a long-lasting, super slick finish. (LipFuel and Weightless Lip Color sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Oleic/Linoleic/Linolenic Polyglycerides, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Silica Dimethyl Silylate; Caprylyl Glycol, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Oil, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glucomannan, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Extract, Lactic Acid, Oenothera Biennis (Evening Primrose) Oil, Palmitoyl Tripeptide-1, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sorbitan Isostearate, Tocopherol, Tribehenin, Trihydroxystearin, Vanillin, Limonene, Linalool, [May Contain/Peut Contenir: Red 28 Lake (CI 45410)]<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
